Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.32,0:00:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pickle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:02:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve to Bergemon and was able to\Ndrive out the black gear and destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.18,0:02:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then Meramon and the\Nvillage went back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.82,0:02:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll just see how long that lasts.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.06,0:02:15.02,Sign,Sign,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Electric Shock! Kabuterimon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.92,0:02:17.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've passed this place before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean we walked all the\Nway around the whole planet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.90,0:02:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That just can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't walk that far, can I?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.34,0:02:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.62,0:02:29.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My feet are hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.54,0:02:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like we're taking a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.96,0:02:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like we\Nhave some place to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.14,0:02:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.16,0:02:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.52,0:02:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check out Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.46,0:02:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he's trying to email the aliens.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.22,0:02:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's asking them to beam him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.38,0:02:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still crashed and the warranty's expired.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.46,0:02:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Izzy, I know how\Nto get it to boot up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.18,0:02:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just gotta give it a\Ncouple of subtle adjustments.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, quit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.91,0:02:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are your brain cells malfunctioning?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.42,0:02:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gosh, you're acting like\NI'm hurting the dumb thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.66,0:02:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad your brain isn't\Nas big as your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.68,0:02:57.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Izzy doesn't want grimy fingerprints\Nand dents all over his computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.54,0:02:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:02:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.80,0:03:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.71,0:03:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you guys see that smoke over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.70,0:03:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.16,0:03:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tai, wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.78,0:03:11.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The attention span of\Na gnat. Uh, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.42,0:03:17.12,Sign,Sign,100,0,80,,{\a8}On
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.48,0:03:16.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got graphics. We got sound.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.19,0:03:17.12,Sign,Sign,0,100,55,,{\a3}Running
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.68,0:03:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Up and right. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.32,0:03:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it indicates the\Nbattery needs recharging.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.68,0:03:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody, get over here, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.56,0:03:30.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.47,0:03:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're coming, Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.52,0:03:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like some kind of factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.06,0:03:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hope they can manufacture\Na way for us to get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.22,0:03:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.13,0:03:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what they make in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.24,0:03:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but wouldn't it be great\Nif there's a manufacturer's outlet store?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:03:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They always have killer deals.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.98,0:04:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me how, but there\Ndoesn't seem to be anybody here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.94,0:04:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's got to be someone\Nrunning the equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.10,0:04:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.01,0:04:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears to be doing\Nquite well all by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.32,0:04:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, what are the machines making?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.18,0:04:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.42,0:04:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe parts for robots or spaceships.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.38,0:04:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody's got to be moving those\Nbelts, and people got to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.42,0:04:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So is there a cafeteria in this place,\Nbecause we can really use a good meal?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.96,0:04:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.87,0:04:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is anybody here? Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.76,0:04:37.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go any further in this direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.08,0:04:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter with this direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.84,0:04:41.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just as good as any\Nother direction, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.08,0:04:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.16,0:04:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, Biyomon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.56,0:04:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.68,0:04:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.60,0:04:49.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.51,0:04:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't sound good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.80,0:04:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we go inside and have a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.30,0:04:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.66,0:04:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.02,0:05:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prodigious!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.93,0:05:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now a battery like that could\Nrun my computer forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.14,0:05:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if there's a\Nway to access its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.80,0:05:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.80,0:05:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.71,0:05:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you suppose happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.32,0:05:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows, but let's see if we can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.76,0:05:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a busted robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.78,0:05:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.10,0:05:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Andromon. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.60,0:05:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This big clunk is a Digimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.44,0:05:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, and very much advanced. Poor thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess he got caught in the gears,\Nand that's how he got mangled.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe if we work together,\Nwe can pull him out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.60,0:05:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My mom really doesn't want\Nme moving any heavy objects.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.20,0:05:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get bad knees. Relax. We'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.44,0:05:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Izzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.86,0:05:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to tap into this power source.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.86,0:05:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can get this baby to fire up, then\Nwe can use my computer to get some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.30,0:05:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, something's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.70,0:06:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's coming loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.74,0:06:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.40,0:06:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he's slowly coming, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.86,0:06:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needs a couple of\Nwhacks for a jump start.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.34,0:06:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Andromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.36,0:06:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's this movie where a robot\Ncame to life and ate everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looks friendly enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.84,0:06:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure if we're nice\Nto him, he'll be nice to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.78,0:06:34.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget what I said about\Nhim being friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.54,0:06:36.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall punish alien intruder.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.73,0:06:45.69,Sign,Sign,0,170,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}ANDROMON
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.73,0:06:45.69,Sign,Sign,350,0,200,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Perfect
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.73,0:06:45.69,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Cyborg\N Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.73,0:06:45.69,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type\N Data
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.73,0:06:45.69,Sign,Sign,350,0,275,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack\NSpiral Sword\NGattling Missiles
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.14,0:06:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andromon is one of the most\Npowerful Digimon of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.96,0:06:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His body is a tireless machine\Ncapable of almost anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.66,0:06:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's give him all we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.20,0:06:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spiral Twister!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.76,0:06:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad we didn't catch him on a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.28,0:07:00.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.19,0:07:01.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it is a good day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.26,0:07:02.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.54,0:07:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Tai, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.02,0:07:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, how about trying\Nto blast the roof?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.36,0:07:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.28,0:07:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, he's going to have one ugly headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.54,0:07:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.70,0:07:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.22,0:07:41.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place would be a lot more interesting\Nif there was a tour guide to explain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.26,0:07:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, maybe with a little\Nplaid outfit and a bullhorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.70,0:07:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:48.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've located an access panel\Nto the interior operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.42,0:07:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let me see, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.48,0:07:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly do you think this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.94,0:08:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These markings are binary\Nannotations of some sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.22,0:08:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A computer program.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.60,0:08:08.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A very complicated program, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.30,0:08:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, who turned out the lights?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.12,0:08:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I break out in hives in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.46,0:08:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.00,0:08:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope it isn't Andromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.16,0:08:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might be a good plan to keep on\Nmoving so we don't have to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.66,0:08:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or we could just stay here\Nfrozen until the monster gets us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.36,0:08:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's sneak away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.32,0:08:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can anyone explain why we're tiptoeing\Ninstead of running for our lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.78,0:08:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intruder sighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.00,0:08:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Andromon doesn't like intruders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.12,0:08:48.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lightning blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:50.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.60,0:08:52.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.12,0:08:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a smooth move, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.34,0:09:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scratch that theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.16,0:09:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could I have possibly\Ndeleted the wrong program?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.78,0:09:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that is a distinct\Npossibility, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try to undelete it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.70,0:09:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Capital idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A stroke of metallic paint right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.76,0:09:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voila!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.76,0:09:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't pay their\Npower bill, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.02,0:09:21.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you have no imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's rather mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.64,0:09:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just what is so mysterious about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.28,0:09:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, batteries are driven\Nby an acidic chemical reaction,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which generates a current.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this one produces its\Nown current independently.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.72,0:09:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what does that mean\Nin plain English for
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.74,0:09:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those of us who didn't\Nmajor in engineering?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.84,0:09:40.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a nano here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll even give you three.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.96,0:09:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can decode this particular program,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.82,0:09:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I can trace its base functions\Nand figure a way out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.40,0:09:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here! Get closer!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.10,0:09:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.24,0:10:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.76,0:10:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lightning Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear me, intruders!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.78,0:10:44.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andromon will exact his vengeance
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.68,0:10:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vengeance, we're the ones that\Njump-started you, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.46,0:10:54.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admire the way you keep\Nworking while your friends
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.28,0:10:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are out having fun. Don't you\Never feel sort of left out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.36,0:11:02.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all So you would rather spend\Nyour time with puzzles than with people?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.46,0:11:04.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Precisely What could be\Nmore fun than breaking
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.24,0:11:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a cryptogram that nobody\Nelse can figure out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.48,0:11:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can think of a lot of things like\Nrelaxing on a nice warm beach but
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.64,0:11:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're not worrying about being\Ntrapped in a small room with no exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.64,0:11:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.06,0:11:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to determine\Nhow we all got to this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.30,0:11:19.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'd like to learn\Nmore about you, Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.60,0:11:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps prove some of my theories.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.52,0:11:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you theorizing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.04,0:11:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big mystery?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.12,0:11:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.26,0:11:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not hiding anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.64,0:11:27.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.55,0:11:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I simply can't understand this\Npreoccupation with who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there some kind of deep,\Ndark secret in your origins?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.74,0:11:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.22,0:11:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't you think it's time we\Ntold izzy the truth dear no
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.98,0:11:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm afraid if we told him now\Nit might be too big of a shock
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i know you're trying to do\Nwhat's best but i worry that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.24,0:11:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,once he finds out he'll be\Nupset we didn't tell him sooner
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.14,0:11:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well we just can't think about\Nthat now izzy izzy huh oh
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:12:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what did you say you were off\Nin another world look at the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Screen huh? It's acting rather\Nstrangely. Perhaps you should
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:08.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stop focusing on the problem and\Nstart looking for a solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.66,0:12:10.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your friends are in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.18,0:12:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you feel it in your bones?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.48,0:12:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.39,0:12:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my Digivice has been activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.56,0:12:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, that's productive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.18,0:12:23.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This thing puts the pieces together,\Nand then it takes them apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.46,0:12:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tentomon to Izzy, are you reading me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.88,0:12:33.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is merely scientific speculations,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.00,0:12:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I believe I've stumbled onto something\Nmore than just a simple computer game,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.86,0:12:40.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm about to abandon\Nmy alien theory as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.40,0:12:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my, it's getting hot in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.60,0:12:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, I'm burning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.38,0:12:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do something quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.58,0:12:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm being sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.49,0:12:49.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.06,0:12:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it. Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.12,0:12:56.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it short-circuiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.64,0:12:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.06,0:13:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm dancing like I've never danced before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.34,0:13:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm disconnecting the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.60,0:13:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I may never figure\Nthe mystery out. Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't like computers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.54,0:13:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to my digivice?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.52,0:13:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Andromon will exact his vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.46,0:13:15.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.37,0:13:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just try it, you tin can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.50,0:13:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.42,0:13:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you please stop\Ntaunting the deranged android?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.84,0:13:25.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.96,0:13:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Round interrupt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.50,0:13:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Altitude reading abnormal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.06,0:13:36.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, I'm bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.38,0:13:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gray is really my least favorite color,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.04,0:13:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and all this deconstructionism\Nis so ten minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.72,0:13:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are we still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.16,0:13:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're still here because we're trying to\Nfigure out what gets built in this factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.70,0:13:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So far, it just seems designed to put\Nthings together and then take them apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really, really hope they\Ndesigned it with a door.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.08,0:13:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no door.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.48,0:13:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's based on perpetual motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.40,0:13:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing ever stops or leaves this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.44,0:14:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:03.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never guess what I just discovered!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.18,0:14:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vengeance!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.32,0:14:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's up? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.08,0:14:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the computer program operating\Nthis factory is what's
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,producing the generating\Npower to keep it going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.30,0:14:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even more incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.04,0:14:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In DigiWorld, basic data and simple\Ninformation are a living, viable substance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.76,0:14:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.84,0:14:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.34,0:14:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like the tone of his voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.36,0:14:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have got to get out of here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Tai?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.54,0:14:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Capture intruders.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sensors detect hostility.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.40,0:14:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring intruders into firing range.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.40,0:14:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.31,0:14:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Frigimon, are you talking to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:44.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring missiles to position.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.90,0:14:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.64,0:14:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T .K! Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.50,0:15:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.04,0:15:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.18,0:15:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Garurumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.98,0:15:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.64,0:15:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.04,0:15:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digiball, two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.22,0:15:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.94,0:15:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who challenges Andromon?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.30,0:16:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bundling weaklings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.26,0:16:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him, Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.92,0:16:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Recycle that hunk of tin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.54,0:16:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You beauty ones dare to challenge me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.02,0:16:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lightning blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.16,0:16:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's more powerful than\Neither of our Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.88,0:16:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe because he's all machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.22,0:16:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost like he's Digivol\Nfar beyond the other Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.82,0:16:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it possible that we could lose?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.40,0:16:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's beaten them both\Nnow looks like there's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.94,0:16:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no hope try re-entering that program that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.22,0:17:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,activated your digivice\Nwhat for i believe that's
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.76,0:17:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the key to my digivolving\Nyes it's gotta work
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.46,0:17:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if i can just recall the exact sequence
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.04,0:17:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cracked the program. Yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.14,0:17:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take them on! Digivolve to Kabuterimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.78,0:18:06.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring missiles to position.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.30,0:18:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.56,0:18:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, doesn't that Andromon\Never run out of gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.28,0:18:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.19,0:18:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.86,0:18:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.76,0:18:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut his power!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.40,0:18:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demobilize his right leg and\Nwill interrupt his energy source!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.04,0:18:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Electro-shocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.64,0:18:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He stripped a gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.24,0:18:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must have hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.86,0:18:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.92,0:19:04.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That black gear reprogrammed\Nmy system somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.84,0:19:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm normally a non-violent Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.06,0:19:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you could have fooled us no kidding i told\Nyou he's a digimon and not an android i
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.56,0:19:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never meant to hurt anyone don't give it\Nanother thought hey we all make mistakes i
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.70,0:19:22.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can't answer your questions about how this
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.50,0:19:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,place came to be or\Nwhat it's for but i can
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.62,0:19:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be of some help the\Nbest way to escape from
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.18,0:19:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,here is to follow the underground waterway
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.92,0:19:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the labyrinth begins just\Nbeyond this point thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.92,0:19:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for your help andromon i\Nhope you find your way home,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.90,0:19:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and no matter what, try to remember the\Nbig guy that turned out to be not so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.00,0:19:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's one thing you can count on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll never forget you, Andromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.80,0:19:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.38,0:19:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.54,0:19:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, ready, set.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.04,0:19:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, that only took four minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.96,0:19:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.94,0:19:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I the only one who\Nfinds strolling leisurely
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.38,0:20:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,through the sewers just the\Nslightest bit disgusting?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.12,0:20:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth, Izzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.86,0:20:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it your computer that made\NTentomon turn into a superhero?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.88,0:20:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prodigious, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.86,0:20:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could your computer make\NPatamon become a superhero?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.70,0:20:12.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose that is possible. Wow, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.10,0:20:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.40,0:20:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.56,0:20:18.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's strange. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.86,0:20:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The program's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.06,0:20:26.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But nothing is happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.74,0:20:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give it a few whacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.44,0:20:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.44,0:20:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us try.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.48,0:20:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.78,0:20:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, guys, but a computer is not a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.38,0:20:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that you boys have holes in your head,\Nmaybe your brains will get enough oxygen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.54,0:21:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The future of the rain\Nwill shine on the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.54,0:22:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll remember the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.54,0:22:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That day, that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.26,0:22:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:01.51,0:23:05.00,Sign,Sign,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Palmon's Angry Evolution!

